 ### Data Structures
-*   **Position Buffer $B_P$:** A 2D array of size $W \times H$ (screen resolution). Each element stores the 3D world position $\mathbf{p} = (x, y, z)$ of the first-hit isosurface point corresponding to the screen pixel.
